## Rewrite collapsed Unity Catalog FQNs in mapping SQL
================================================================================

Context: Auto-map / mapping assistants quoted a full catalog.schema.table
name as one identifier (FROM `a.b.c` instead of `a`.`b`.`c`). Spark treats
that as a single name and fails to resolve the source table (GH #214, BCP
loyalty mapping). The LLM was following a "always backtick-quote columns"
habit. Add a deterministic rewrite, diagnostics, prompt guard, and eval
regression so it cannot regress.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/databricks/uc/identifiers.py
   Detect and rewrite `FROM`/`JOIN` `` `a.b.c` `` to `` `a`.`b`.`c` ``.
2. src/back/core/helpers/SQLHelpers.py
   Expose rewrite/find helpers and a Mapping diagnostics check dict.
3. src/agents/tools/mapping.py, src/agents/tools/sql.py
   Rewrite on Auto-Map submit and execute_sql before the warehouse sees SQL.
4. src/back/objects/mapping/Mapping.py
   Rewrite on persist and diagnostics probe; flag remaining collapsed FQNs.
5. src/back/core/sqlwizard/SQLWizardService.py,
   src/back/core/w3c/sparql/SparqlTranslator.py,
   src/back/core/w3c/r2rml/R2RMLGenerator.py
   Rewrite on wizard correction, SPARQL subquery, and R2RML rr:sqlQuery.
6. src/agents/agent_auto_assignment/engine.py,
   src/agents/agent_mapping_pge/generators/entity.py,
   src/agents/agent_mapping_pge/generators/relationship.py
   Prompt: never wrap the full catalog.schema.table in one pair of backticks.
7. tests/eval/datasets/agent_auto_assignment/regression.jsonl,
   tests/eval/datasets/agent_mapping_pge/regression.jsonl
   Three GH #214 regression examples per agent.
8. docs/user-guide.md
   Document per-segment UC quoting vs the illegal collapsed form.

