   Remove unused `precision_score` session field and `/domain/info` payload.
8. pyproject.toml, uv.lock, requirements.txt, Makefile, scripts/start.sh, scripts/setup.sh
   Remove the `[pitfalls]` extra and lock entries unique to it (NLTK,
   sentence-transformers, torch, transformers, CUDA/nvidia wheels).
9. licenses/README.md
   Drop D2KLab/NLTK/sentence-transformers license rows; keep sklearn/SciPy as
